# UI & Project Structure

Stack: **Next.js App Router + React Server Components**, **shadcn/ui** (style `base-maia`,
`@base-ui/react` under the hood), **hugeicons** for icons, Tailwind, path alias `@/*`.

## shadcn/ui only — no raw UI

- **Always** import primitives from `@/components/ui/*`. Never hand-write HTML for a primitive
  that shadcn provides (button, input, card, dialog, tabs, sheet, table, …).
- Use **default shadcn variants/slots** (`variant`, `size`, built-in sub-components). Do not
  invent custom Tailwind styling or one-off CSS for primitives.
- Merge extra classes only via `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` — never replace default component styles.
- If a component is missing, add it with the CLI — do not hand-roll a substitute:
  `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` (run inside `frontend/`).
- **Icons:** use `@hugeicons/react` with `@hugeicons/core-free-icons` (matches `components.json`
  `iconLibrary: "hugeicons"`). Do NOT add lucide-react or inline SVGs.

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Button | `Button` from `@/components/ui/button` |
| Inputs / forms | `Input`, `Label`, `Field`, `Form` from `@/components/ui/*` |
| Layout / content | `Card`, `Separator`, `Tabs`, `Sheet`, `Sidebar`, `Table` |
| Feedback | `Alert`, `Dialog`, `Sonner` toast |
| Icon | `<HugeiconsIcon icon={...} />` from `@hugeicons/react` |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — raw HTML + custom classes + inline svg
<button className="rounded bg-blue-500 px-4 py-2">Save</button>

// ✅ GOOD — default shadcn components + cn() for extras
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils"
<Button className={cn("w-full")}>Save</Button>
```

## Server vs client components
- Default to **Server Components**. Add `"use client"` only when you need state, effects, event
  handlers, or browser APIs — keep it on the smallest leaf component.
- Data fetching goes through the **service layer** (see `services.mdc`), never `fetch()` inline
  in a component.

## Folder-first components
Feature UI lives under `components/<feature>/`, never as loose files at `components/` root.
```
components/
  dashboard/
    stats-card.tsx
    usage-chart.tsx
  auth/
    login-form.tsx
  ui/          ← shadcn primitives only (never put feature code here)
```
- One component per file, **kebab-case** filename; export a **named** component.
- Pages compose feature components — **pages stay thin**.

## App routes — route groups
Pages go under `app/(<group>)/`, not directly under `app/`.
```
app/
  (auth)/login/page.tsx        → /login
  (auth)/signup/page.tsx       → /signup
  (dashboard)/page.tsx         → /
  (dashboard)/settings/page.tsx→ /settings
  layout.tsx  globals.css
```
- Parentheses = layout segment, **not** a URL path.
- Shared layout (sidebar, providers) goes in the nearest `layout.tsx` inside the group.
